[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 21242.868, "timestamp": "05:54:02", "text": "我感觉自己快要追上最后一个了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21246.91, "timestamp": "05:54:06", "text": "我直播了DLC的内容。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21250.67, "timestamp": "05:54:10", "text": "我，我和我的Mimo一起做了这件事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21254.27, "timestamp": "05:54:14", "text": "玛梅哈。那是11月份的事了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21257.43, "timestamp": "05:54:17", "text": "2021年。是的。刚才有人打电话过来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21259.99, "timestamp": "05:54:19", "text": "我家的门铃。我的天啊。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21262.03, "timestamp": "05:54:22", "text": "希望这不是一个……那不是一个……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21274.548, "timestamp": "05:54:34", "text": "溪流。让我先处理一下，等我赶上进度。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21277.948, "timestamp": "05:54:37", "text": "所以纳兹说应该"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21281.43, "timestamp": "05:54:41", "text": "好像要摔倒似的。睡吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21283.51, "timestamp": "05:54:43", "text": "之所以如此，是因为有些人不得不接受"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21286.15, "timestamp": "05:54:46", "text": "今天早上感觉还不错。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21289.628, "timestamp": "05:54:49", "text": "你没睡。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21293.15, "timestamp": "05:54:53", "text": "什么？我的天啊。这是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21296.47, "timestamp": "05:54:56", "text": "大部分。我该如何处理"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21298.67, "timestamp": "05:54:58", "text": "[音乐]"}]